# Build output. A single recursive rule covers the workspace, the top-level
# `/target`, and the `target` directory that nested fixture crates such as
# `pinapod/tests/renamed_dependency` create when built from their own manifest.
**/target
/docs/book
/.devenv
/.video_agent
/.mdt

# llvm-cov writes profraw artifacts next to the binaries it runs; they are
# build output, never sources, and have been committed by accident before.
*.profraw
